# The Stop/PostToolUse hooks are bash scripts. Git on Windows checks out CRLF by
# default, and bash fails on a CRLF shebang ("\r: command not found"), which would
# silently disable the phase gate on a fresh clone. Keep them LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf

# CI runs on ubuntu-latest; keep shared config byte-identical across platforms.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Seed catalogue imagery (docs/DATA-MODEL.md, blocker B1) — never line-ending munged.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
